Zenimals is a sleep sound machine. It provides meditations and white noise to help one get to sleep. Zenimal sleep "collections" (audio tracks) are delivered in a proprietary format (on microsd cards) and the device will only play proprietary audio. There is no way for users to play their own audio or repair failed microsd cards.

=== Bounty ===
There currently two bounties known for Zenimals devices, they are hosted on Opire and Github:

==== Reverse Engineer Zenimals Sound Machine ====
Issue Link: https://github.com/TheBigS/zenimals-bounty/issues/1

Bounty: https://app.opire.dev/issues/01K1B9R6GTWXDEAAKMJQ0QAHKV

==== Rip Zenimals Sound Machine Firmware ====
Issue Link: https://github.com/TheBigS/zenimals-bounty/issues/2

Bounty: https://app.opire.dev/issues/01K1BTZMV04S2GWZ887ATRGDH6

